        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-23T02:10:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "can you elaborate this? What are other bytes (0, 2, 3) used for?\n\nAlso, we should check the 2nd byte (bit 8 through 11) of data if module is specified. The 2nd byte has to be zero. Maybe 3rd and 4th should be zero, too.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 37,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 42,
        "endChar": 4
      },
      "revId": "70cb25e6557d8accc71988d5119d5462517e8f1f",
